msgstr "`getAllMetricsForDatetime`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Prometheus metrics at a point in time"
msgstr "某个时间点的 Prometheus 指标"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The LLM orchestrates these tools autonomously -- it decides which traces look interesting, pulls their logs, checks metrics, and builds the analysis iteratively."
msgstr "LLM 会自主协调这些工具——它会判断哪些跟踪记录值得关注，提取相关日志，检查指标，并以迭代的方式构建分析结果。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Analysis Pipeline"
msgstr "分析流程"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "When you hit `GET /analyze/\\{n}`, the following sequence unfolds:"
msgstr "当您调用 `GET /analyze/{n}` 时，将按以下顺序执行："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Tool dispatch* -- The AI module sends the system prompt and tool definitions to the LLM"
msgstr "*工具分发* ——AI模块将系统提示和工具定义发送给LLM"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Trace retrieval* -- The LLM calls `provideLastNTraceIds` to get the N most recent traces"
msgstr "*跟踪检索* ——LLM 调用 `provideLastNTraceIds` 方法以获取最近的 N 个跟踪记录"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Per-trace investigation* -- For each trace, the LLM pulls full trace data and correlated logs through `StripMcpClient`, which strips SDK noise, localhost attributes, and redundant fields"
msgstr "*按跟踪记录进行调查——对于* 每个跟踪记录，LLM 会通过 `StripMcpClient` 提取完整的跟踪数据和相关日志，该工具会过滤掉 SDK 噪声、localhost 属性以及冗余字段"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Metrics context* -- The LLM queries Prometheus metrics at the root span's start time; the filtering layer removes Netty/OTel internals, static counters, and histogram bucket breakdowns"
msgstr "*指标上下文——大型* 语言模型（LLM）会在根跨度（span）的起始时间查询 Prometheus 指标；过滤层会移除 Netty/OTel 的内部数据、静态计数器以及直方图桶的细分数据"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Analysis synthesis* -- The LLM produces a structured report with per-trace sections covering root cause, slowest operations, error patterns, and cross-trace correlation"
msgstr "*分析与综合——该* 大型语言模型（LLM）会生成一份结构化的报告，其中按每个跟踪记录划分章节，分别涵盖根本原因、最慢操作、错误模式以及跨跟踪记录的相关性。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "If source examination or dashboard generation is enabled, a post-analysis pipeline kicks in using `DevMcpAiService` -- a separate `@RegisterAiService` that uses Dev MCP tools to read application source code and write Grafana dashboard JSON back to each workspace."
msgstr "如果启用了源代码检查或仪表盘生成功能，则会触发一个基于 `DevMcpAiService` 的分析后处理管道 `——这是一个` 独立的 `@RegisterAiService` ，它利用 Dev MCP 工具读取应用程序源代码，并将 Grafana 仪表盘的 JSON 数据写回各个工作区。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Data Filtering: Staying Within Context Limits"
msgstr "数据过滤：保持在上下文限制范围内"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "One of the trickiest engineering challenges is keeping telemetry data within LLM context limits while preserving signal. The `StripMcpClient` decorator applies per-tool filtering functions:"
msgstr "最棘手的工程挑战之一，是在保持信号质量的同时，将遥测数据控制在大型语言模型（LLM）的上下文限制内。 `StripMcpClient` 装饰器会应用针对每种工具的过滤函数："

#, fuzzy
msgid "*Traces*: Removes SDK metadata (`telemetry.sdk.*`, `otel.*`), localhost attributes, and instrumentation library details"
msgstr "*Traces* ：移除 SDK 元数据（ `telemetry.sdk. **` *、otel.* ）、localhost 属性以及仪器化库的详细信息"

#, fuzzy
msgid "*Logs*: Strips SDK metadata, redundant fields, and duplicate information already present in trace spans"
msgstr "*日志* ：去除 SDK 元数据、冗余字段以及已在跟踪跨度中存在的重复信息"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Metrics*: Removes Netty internals, static/constant values, histogram bucket breakdowns, and per-region metric breakdowns -- reducing 586 entries to ~35"
msgstr "*指标* ：移除了 Netty 的内部实现、静态/常量值、直方图桶细分以及按区域划分的指标细分——将 586 个条目减少至约 35 个"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The system prompt also instructs the LLM to treat chaos-related log entries as authoritative evidence, even when Prometheus metrics don't confirm them -- because point-in-time metric snapshots can miss transient pressure spikes that logs capture."
msgstr "系统提示还指示大型语言模型（LLM）将与系统混乱相关的日志条目视为权威证据，即使Prometheus指标未能证实这些条目——因为特定时间点的指标快照可能会遗漏日志中捕获的瞬时压力峰值。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Testing with Chaos Engineering"
msgstr "基于混沌工程的测试"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "How do you test an AI-powered analysis tool? You need realistic failure scenarios with known root causes, and you need an objective way to score the analysis quality. AI Root Cause Analysis solves this with chaos engineering + LLM-as-judge evaluation."
msgstr "如何测试一款基于人工智能的分析工具？你需要具备已知根本原因的现实故障场景，同时也需要一种客观的方法来评估分析质量。AI 根本原因分析通过混沌工程与“大语言模型（LLM）作为评委”的评估方式解决了这一问题。"

