#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Beyond application-level chaos, the test suite also covers infrastructure-level failures using https://github.com/Shopify/toxiproxy[*Toxiproxy*] -- a TCP proxy that can inject latency, cut connections, and throttle bandwidth at the network layer:"
msgstr "除了应用层混乱之外，该测试套件还利用 link:https://github.com/Shopify/toxiproxy[Toxiproxy] （ link:https://github.com/Shopify/toxiproxy[一种] 可在网络层注入延迟、中断连接并限制带宽的TCP代理）来模拟基础设施层的故障："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Database chaos* routes JDBC connections through Toxiproxy to MySQL:"
msgstr "*Database Chaos* 通过 Toxiproxy 将 JDBC 连接转发至 MySQL："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tests include slow queries (3s latency injection), connection pool exhaustion (4s latency + small pool + concurrent requests), and full database outages (connection cut). JDBC telemetry creates separate database query spans, so the AI sees `GET /poke (3019ms) -> SELECT ... (3015ms)` and can identify database-level root causes."
msgstr "测试内容包括慢查询（注入3秒延迟）、连接池耗尽（4秒延迟 + 小型连接池 + 并发请求）以及数据库完全中断（连接中断）。 JDBC 遥测会生成独立的数据库查询跨度，因此 AI 会看到 `GET /poke (3019 毫秒) → SELECT …​ (3015 毫秒)` ，从而能够识别数据库层面的根本原因。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Weather API chaos* routes REST client calls through Toxiproxy to an external API:"
msgstr "*Weather API chaos* 将 REST 客户端请求通过 Toxiproxy 转发至外部 API："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tests include slow external API responses and full API outages."
msgstr "测试内容包括外部 API 响应缓慢以及 API 完全中断。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "No application code changes are required -- chaos is injected purely at the network layer via the Toxiproxy REST API."
msgstr "无需修改应用程序代码——完全通过 Toxiproxy REST API 在网络层注入混乱。"

